+# C0 review response: recovery direction and crash reconstruction
+
+Status: LOCAL DRAFT, NOT PUBLISHED OR INDEPENDENTLY APPROVED.
+Base review: PR #104 at `0219a7fee95bdd744e52b8fa2eb5c5978e661964`.
+Runtime: unchanged `82b54ef9b7c8d6be9f2d6450cbc5e6713ade00af`.
